Spawn conditions ----------
Door Zombies spawn with a random door.
I would advise making them about half as rare as a Buckethead?
You do you, though.

70% - Screen Door
20% - Biome-based Door (more on that later)
7.5% - Copper Door
2.5% - Iron Door

Baby Zombies spawn with a trapdoor instead!
Scale those down 10% if you are able. There is
an example of what this should look like in here.
-----------------------------
Defenses -------------------
Door Zombies take less damage from the front.
Essentially, it acts like frontal armor of that tier.

8 armor   - Basic Doors
10 armor - Copper Door
15 armor  - Iron Doors

Door Zombies also take 50% damage from projectiles
that hit them in the front. Reminder to NOT count above
them for this calculation. Make a frontal hitbox.
-----------------------------
Drops ----------------------
Door Zombies always drop their held door on death.
It cannot be re-equipped by a player. 
